# 行尾归一：钉死，覆盖各机飘忽的 core.autocrlf，杜绝 sync-home/xcopy 引发的 CRLF 幽灵 diff
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止行尾/文本转换
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.wasm binary
